      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11509674::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo addition promotes formation of a continuous, stable, Mo-rich passive layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo addition refines the alloy microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mo-induced microstructural change increases hardness.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A more durable Mo-associated passive film resists localized pitting corrosion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased hardness from Mo addition decreases wear-induced damage.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mo-added alloy will have a lower wear rate than the baseline alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mo-added alloy will have a lower corrosion current density than the baseline alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11509674::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under simultaneous wear and corrosion, total degradation will be lower in the Mo-containing alloy because of improved passive-film stability and greater hardness.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo reduces mechanical removal and pitting degradation in aggressive, flow-induced, chloride-rich environments.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11509674::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective effects of Mo should hold under moderate to severe corrosive and mechanical conditions.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The benefit may diminish at extremely high temperature, very low pH, or mechanical stress beyond the passive film's ability to reform.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive Mo may produce detrimental phases and diminish the benefit.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prior studies suggest that Mo can improve passive-film stability, corrosion resistance, and wear resistance in high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12072522::web::002::1_introduction",
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quantitative changes in combined degradation and the detailed microstructural evolution during simultaneous wear and corrosion remain insufficiently characterized.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12525669::web::007::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
